<title>USA: Grant Geophysical names J. Kelly Elliott.</title>
<headline>Grant Geophysical names J. Kelly Elliott.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grant Geophysical Inc says it named J. Kelly Elliott chairman to fill the unexpired term of George Tilley who resigned earlier this month..</p>
<p>Elliott served as chairman of the company from June, 19993, to November, 1995.</p>
